Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

LAST-UPDATED reads 201209310000Z, the 31st of September. The newest
REVISION clause in the same MODULE-IDENTITY is 201209300000Z, and the
two are meant to agree, so the repair is that date.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/F3-AMP-MIB
+++ b/F3-AMP-MIB
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
              FROM  CM-IP-MIB;
 
 f3AMPMIB MODULE-IDENTITY
-    LAST-UPDATED        "201209310000Z"
+    LAST-UPDATED        "201209300000Z"
     ORGANIZATION    "ADVA Optical Networking"
     CONTACT-INFO
             "        Jakub Zalewski
